    <briefdescription>
<para>Heuristic mode types for engine selection. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file defines the heuristic modes used when querying available engines for an operation graph. Different modes provide different trade-offs between search time and result quality. </para>
